//*                                                                             
//*  PROCEDUREN KÖRS I FLERA RUTINER, INDUT ANGES I RESP JCL                    
//*                                                                             
//*                                                                             
//*  FREKVENS:     DAG    RTN W271D1                                            
//*                       RTN W271DA                                            
